helvetica,sans-serif\">Is there a way of exporting the tree with the nodes numbers on it, so I can make sure I&#39;m choosing the right nodes? Or any other solution?<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Any idea is welcome.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Best for ow,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Boni</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">​​</div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><br></font></span></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">-- <br><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Esther Nieto<div>PhD Student</div><div>Department of Biology</div><div>Memorial University of Newfoundland</div><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">St. John&#39;s, NL, </span><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">A1B 3X9, Canada</span><br></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://julissaroncal.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://julissaroncal.wordpress.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485272397000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1kucNnNe1T3CZ3R1G00aHX\">https://julissaroncal.wordpress.com/</a><br></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://antonelli-lab.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://antonelli-lab.net/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485272397000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nSMum91t55XH2km4px6-A\">http://antonelli-lab.net/</a><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n</font></span></di